{"id":"6cfc6a383edf25e5","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-schnorr-dimensions.md","title":"Schnorr Hausdorff 维数与 packing 维数","display":"df-schnorr-dimensions — Schnorr Hausdorff 维数与 packing 维数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-schnorr-dimensions","aliases":["43-df-schnorr-dimensions"],"display":"df-schnorr-dimensions — Schnorr Hausdorff 维数与 packing 维数","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorr-s-test]]","[[43-df-martingale]]","[[43-df-computable-real]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definitions 17.8.5 and 17.8.8; Definition 17.6.8","source_printed_pages":"535,537;530","source_pdf_pages":"555,557;550","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-schnorr-dimensions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-schnorr-dimensions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-schnorr-dimensions — Schnorr Hausdorff 维数与 packing 维数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fe3a2e8b1893c3da\" href=\"?note=fe3a2e8b1893c3da\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-s-test\">43-df-schnorr-s-test</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0038977b84ae1a9f\" href=\"?note=0038977b84ae1a9f\" title=\"43-df-martingale\">43-df-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"96d58aa7b6884a9b\" href=\"?note=96d58aa7b6884a9b\" title=\"43-df-computable-real\">43-df-computable-real</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definitions 17.8.5 and 17.8.8; Definition 17.6.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"535,537;530"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"555,557;550"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal X\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to[0,\\infty)\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to[0,\\infty)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SchnorrSNull}\">\\(\\operatorname{SchnorrSNull}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fe3a2e8b1893c3da\" href=\"?note=fe3a2e8b1893c3da\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-s-test\">43-df-schnorr-s-test</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Martingale}\">\\(\\operatorname{Martingale}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}\">\\(\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0038977b84ae1a9f\" href=\"?note=0038977b84ae1a9f\" title=\"43-df-martingale\">43-df-martingale</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"96d58aa7b6884a9b\" href=\"?note=96d58aa7b6884a9b\" title=\"43-df-computable-real\">43-df-computable-real</a>。上下极限在扩展非负实数中取值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty\">\\(\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{SH}(\\mathcal X)\\coloneqq\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}:\\operatorname{SchnorrSNull}(s,\\mathcal X)\\},\\qquad\\dim_{SH}(X)\\coloneqq\\dim_{SH}(\\{X\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\dim_{SH}(\\mathcal X)\\coloneqq\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}:\\operatorname{SchnorrSNull}(s,\\mathcal X)\\},\\qquad\\dim_{SH}(X)\\coloneqq\\dim_{SH}(\\{X\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrongExponentialSuccess}(s,d,X)\\iff\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{d(X\\upharpoonright n)}{2^{(1-s)n}}=+\\infty.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StrongExponentialSuccess}(s,d,X)\\iff\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{d(X\\upharpoonright n)}{2^{(1-s)n}}=+\\infty.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{SP}(X)\\coloneqq\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}:\\exists d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to[0,\\infty)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Martingale}(d)\\land\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}(d)\\land\\operatorname{StrongExponentialSuccess}(s,d,X)\\right)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\dim_{SP}(X)\\coloneqq\\inf\\{s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}:\\exists d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to[0,\\infty)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Martingale}(d)\\land\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}(d)\\land\\operatorname{StrongExponentialSuccess}(s,d,X)\\right)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>packing 一侧要求资本相对指数阶最终持续超过每个界。s&gt;1 时常值正鞅满足该强成功条件，因此该下确界有非空候选集。类级 Hausdorff 维数不擅自等同于类中单点维数上确界；c.e. 类是这种稳定性失效的例子。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Definitions 17.8.5 and 17.8.8; Definition 17.6.8，印刷页 535,537;530，PDF 页 555,557;550。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorr-s-test","status":"resolved","id":"fe3a2e8b1893c3da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorr-s-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"0038977b84ae1a9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-real","status":"resolved","id":"96d58aa7b6884a9b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorr-s-test","status":"resolved","id":"fe3a2e8b1893c3da","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal X\\subseteq2^\\omega$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to[0,\\infty)$。$\\operatorname{SchnorrSNull}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-s-test]]；$\\operatorname{Martingale}$、$\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-real]]。上下极限在扩展非负实数中取值，$\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"0038977b84ae1a9f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal X\\subseteq2^\\omega$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to[0,\\infty)$。$\\operatorname{SchnorrSNull}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-s-test]]；$\\operatorname{Martingale}$、$\\operatorname{UniformComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-real]]。上下极限在扩展非负实数中取值，$\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-real","status":"resolved","id":"96d58aa7b6884a9b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[H